<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=781&lastnode_id=1706">Inertia</a> on 2001-05-05 09:43:57</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>I would like to take the time to publicly thank Annilaotor Doomreaper for aiding me in gettiing the Power of Air for my Epic Quest in Mistmoore the other night.  His knowledge of the zone proved to be invaluable to being able to get the item in only one night.  I would never have been able to reach this goal without his help (and large mass).  I also learned the layout and dangers of a new location, which I am sure will be useful in the future.  In addition to getting the Power of Air, I came away with a Noble's Robe, which will be great when I sell items, as it adds 5 CHA. 8^)  Again thanks a lot Annilaotor!!<br>
<br>
Also I would like to thank Kajen, Zhokaii, Kolu and anyone else I missed in inviting me along to Disco in Sebils the other night.  Because of that I now have some new black robes.  (Froglok Bonecasters Robes)  8^)<br>
<br>
And last but certainly not least a round of thanks to all who helped in the City of Mist Raid.  Yet another piece of my Epic was achieved.  (Torch of the Elements).<br>
<br>
When we work together, nothing can resist our might.  Let the blood FLOW.<br>
<br>
Inertia Dampers</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>

